# Per-machine runtime config. The bootstrap (src/setup/) rewrites this on every
# launch with values derived from the local GPU/VRAM/RAM — gpuLayers, threads,
# contextSize, laya.port — so it is a property of the BOX, not of the project,
# and committing it makes every user's machine share one machine's tuning.
# `.harnesside/rules/` stays tracked: those are meant to be shared.
.harnesside/config.yaml
*.log
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# 데몬 로그/체크포인트 (비영속)
.harnesside/state/
*.log
